v 3
d cge -- Computable general equilibrium (CGE) modelling in Stata
d
d Builds, calibrates and solves SAM-based CGE models: static simulations,
d recursive dynamics and perfect foresight with user-specified equations.
d Links calibrated regions through bilateral trade and supports standalone
d user-defined models, complementarity, nonlinear and integer optimisation,
d policy optimisation, and Nash and Stackelberg games.
d Includes SAM preparation and balancing, multiplier and structural path
d analysis, scenario loops, validation, sensitivity and household microsimulation.
d Built-in solvers use Stata and Mata; optional experimental SciPy links
d require Stata 16+ with Python and SciPy. GAMS export and GDX exchange are available.
d
d Requires: Stata 13 or later
d Author: Mustapha Wasseja Mohammed
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261026
d
